{"id":"459559f62cf1b044","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-cartesian-product.md","title":"Cartesian Product","display":"df-cartesian-product — Cartesian Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cartesian-product","aliases":["58-df-cartesian-product","58-df-zfc-set-cartesian-product"],"display":"df-cartesian-product — Cartesian Product","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cartesian-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cartesian-product</span><span>58-df-zfc-set-cartesian-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cartesian-product — Cartesian Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,P\\in V\">\\(A,B,P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\">\\(A\\times B\\)</span>（由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a> 定义的集合笛卡尔积）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetCartesianProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetCartesianProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（兼容别名谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetCartesianProduct}_S(P,A,B)\\leftrightarrow P=A\\times B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" a